id, “Isn’t this Joseph’s son?”","source":"web"},{"ref":"John 1:7","note":"The same came as a witness, that he might testify about the light, that all might believe through him.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Acts 6:3","note":"Therefore select from among you, brothers, seven men of good report, full of the Holy Spirit and of wisdom, whom we may appoint over this business.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Romans 3:21","note":"But now apart from the law, a righteousness of God has been revealed, being testified by the law and the prophets;","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Corinthians 15:15","note":"Yes, we are also found false witnesses of God, because we testified about God that he raised up Christ, whom he didn’t raise up, if it is so that the dead are…","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Corinthians 8:3","note":"For according to their power, I testify, yes and beyond their power, they gave of their own accord,","source":"web"},{"ref":"Galatians 4:15","note":"What was the blessing you enjoyed? For I testify to you that, if possible, you would have plucked out your eyes and given them to me.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"G1909","lemma":"ἐπί","transliteration":"epi","gloss":"upon/to/against"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}